// aitype as HydraX writes it: offsets into HydraX's stitched buffer (sections), generated from
// HydraX's tables; a hand edit says why in a comment.
// hand edit: team (HydraX 0x33: 1 allies, 2 axis, 3 team3, 19 neutral) and
// animMappingTableDefault (0x34: "table" + index + 1) as enums; primaryAllowedCamos (0x39) and
// validationRequiredBones (0x3a) as script string arrays joined by \r\n (HydraX: every slot,
// a trailing \r\n); primaryBannedAttachments (0x38) written empty: HydraX writes the 64 raw
// numbers in hex, which are not the attachment names the Mod Tools' text holds
